458
00:53:45,980 --> 00:53:48,050
Ci abita un nostro amico .

459
00:53:48,540 --> 00:53:49,939
Ho capito .

460
00:53:50,340 --> 00:53:51,693
Ho capito .

461
00:53:53,500 --> 00:53:55,138
